Subject: [PATCH] Require complete Blu-ray playlist filenames

Backport the playlist discovery fix from 78andyp and Team Kodi.
https://github.com/xbmc/xbmc/pull/30340 (GPL-2.0-or-later).
Use absolute PCRE2 anchors so a trailing newline is not part of a playlist name.

--- a/xbmc/filesystem/BlurayDirectory.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/filesystem/BlurayDirectory.cpp
@@ -184,7 +184,8 @@ bool GetPlaylistsFromDisc(const CURL& url,
     return false;
 
   // Get information on all playlists
-  CRegExp pl{true, CRegExp::autoUtf8, R"((\d{5}.mpls))"};
+  // Ignore sidecars such as 00000.mpls.hash.
+  CRegExp pl{true, CRegExp::autoUtf8, R"(\A(\d{5})\.mpls\z)"};
   for (const auto& title : allTitles)
   {
     const CURL url3{title->GetPath()};
